A '''llama''' is a [[Taming#List of mobs|tameable]] [[neutral mob]] that can be equipped with a [[chest]] to transport [[item]]s, and can also wear [[carpet]]s. If attacked, it will retaliate using its [[spit]].

== Spawning ==
A llama spawns above on [[grass block]]s in [[savanna plateau]], [[savanna]]{{only|be|short=1}}<ref>{{bug|MC-159092||Llamas do not spawn in regular savanna biome|WAI}}</ref> or [[windswept savanna]]{{only|be|short=1}} [[biome]]s in herds of 4 llamas, and in [[windswept hills]], [[windswept forest]], and [[windswept gravelly hills]] biomes in herds of 4 to 6 llamas, coming in four coat colors: brown, cream, white or gray.

10% of llamas spawn as baby llamas.

{{Mob spawn table|Llama}}

