=== Carpets ===
[[File:All Llama swag patterns.png|thumb|right|350px|All llama carpet patterns.]]
A tamed llama can be equipped with a wool [[carpet]] in its carpet slot. Each carpet color shows as a different patterned rug when on the llama's back. This can be useful for color-coding the llamas as storage containers, like dyed [[shulker box]]es.

When given carpets, all types of llamas look the same, except for their fur colors. {{IN|java}}, a llama's carpet decoration, including the default blue rug of a trader llama, remains visible when the llama is under the effect of [[Invisibility]];<ref>{{bug|MC-110423||Invisibility effect don't affect the second layer skins of stray and llama|WAI}}</ref> {{in|bedrock}}, it becomes invisible.

For the purposes of the {{cmd|item}} [[Commands|command]], a llama carries its carpet in the <code>armor.body</code> slot.

